    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the parks, recreation and historic preservation law, in relation to establishing the Heights Heritage Area; and to repeal certain provisions of such law relating thereto",
    "basePrintNo": "S6678",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S6678-2017",
    "coSponsors": {
